:: Pub Flirt Intercept
/* X-Change: Intercepts the standard Pub Flirt option so Whitney can intervene on Sunday nights
(after orphanage special progression). Falls back to the vanilla "Pub Flirt" passage. */
<<effects>>
<<if Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour gte 21 and C.npc.Whitney.state is "active"
	and $whitney_orphanage_special_seen gte 3 and !$weekly.whitneyPub>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<set $weekly.whitneyPubFlirt to 1>>
	<<include "Whitney Pub Intervene">>
<<else>>
	<<if Story.has("Pub Flirt")>>
		<<include "Pub Flirt">>
	<<else>>
		Something went wrong. You can't find someone suitable to flirt with.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Back|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Whitney Pub Intervene
<<effects>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>>
You sit down at a stranger's table and start flirting, smiling and keeping your voice sweet. The stranger leans closer, pleased with the attention.
Then you notice Whitney watching you from across the room. <<He>> isn't smirking like usual. <<He>> looks <i>jealous</i>.
<br><br>
You keep talking anyway. You lower your voice and laugh a little more, knowing Whitney can see all of it.
A chair scrapes loudly across the floor. You don't have to look to know who stood up.
<br><br>
Whitney laughs as <<he>> crosses the pub, as if nobody here would dare stop <<him>>. <<He>> stops right at your shoulder, close enough that the stranger notices <<him>>, and the stranger's smile falters.
<<if C.npc.Whitney.love gte 20>>
	"Well ain't that cute. Tryna make me jealous, slut?"
<<elseif C.npc.Whitney.dom gte 20>>
	<<He>> dips <<his>> head, <<his>> voice lowering just for you to hear. "Eyes up. Don't pretend you didn't see me."
<<else>>
	Whitney looks the stranger up and down before glancing at you. "Seriously? This is what you're doing?"
<</if>>
<<if $xchange.pill.clone isnot "none">>
    <br><br>
	Whitney's grin changes when <<he>> takes a closer look at your borrowed face and body.
	"Ha. And then look at you. Wearing someone else's skin!"
